      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Pre-Loading Inspection, Odometer Logging &amp; Photographic Audit for Bike Transportation Kalyandurg Safe</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Before any bike or motorcycle is shipped—whether by bus, train, or via the Indian Railway bike parcel service—an exhaustive pre‑loading protocol guarantees safe, compliant transport. A 360‑degree digital condition audit captures every visual and sensor‑based detail of the chassis, tires, and electronics. Battery terminal checks verify polarity, corrosion, and secure fasteners.</p>
