    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Manage FASTag details by verifying that the tag is active, linked to the correct account, and that the balance covers all tolls along the intended route. For train‑based shipments, ensure that the bus or truck transporting the bike to the rail yard has a valid FASTag for any toll crossings.</p>
